# The artifacts in this directory are exact wire bytes, not source files.
#
# Any end-of-line or whitespace normalisation corrupts them: the signatures
# cover the bytes as committed, and the JSON envelopes deliberately carry no
# trailing newline. -text switches conversion off in both directions, so a
# checkout on a host with core.autocrlf=true gets the committed bytes rather
# than a CRLF rendering of them.
#
# README.md is deliberately not listed; it is an ordinary source file.
key-id.txt          -text
signing-key.pub.pem -text
*.json              -text
